WrEC jcHTKK pf-413_"><img alt="rectangle-38-1679020235497__PID:fb886438-95cc-4604-9867-c1ae2aa249aa" src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=2048" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=375 375w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=550 550w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=768 768w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=1024 1024w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=1280 1280w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=1440 1440w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=1680 1680w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=1800 1800w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=1920 1920w,https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2170/1117/files/rectangle-38-1679020235497.png?v=1729741573&width=2048 2048w" fetchPriority="low" decoding="async" loading="lazy" style="--pf-image-ratio:1.340625" width="429" height="320" sizes="75vw" data-pf-type="Image4" class="sc-fyVeKD iXEsDR pf-414_" store="[object Object]"/><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-cezzpg bKVrKR pf-415_"><h3 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-lbJdeI eAgijX pf-416_">Prescription Sun</h3><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-418_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Prescription sunglasses combine all the benefits of sunglasses: vision correction with 100% UV protection, polarization for enhanced contrast, and stylish look.</p><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-dMhVqw bOfbPY pf-420_">Shop Prescription Sun Lenses</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-section-id="pf-8be5" data-pf-type="FlexSection" class="sc-iLLNPL gwQAXy pf-425_ pf-lg-hide pf-md-hide pf-sm-hide pf-hide"><div class="sc-bhqpXc hXWaGz pf-flex-section"><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-426_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">FAQ</p><h2 data-pf-type="Heading2" class="sc-lbJdeI eAgijX pf-428_">Frequently asked questions</h2><div data-pf-type="FlexBlock" class="sc-cezzpg bKVrKR pf-430_"><div class="sc-knuQPt daAiLp pf-431_ pf-icon-right" data-scroll-to-top="true" data-open-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3"><details class="sc-EROOM jpOqOK pf-432_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-gvZzpm iHUDiY pf-433_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="0a664022-1783-4ca8-a7bb-d2a341cf9188" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>How do I know which lenses work best for my prescription?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi pf-435_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-beZfNf kdmZzm pf-436_"><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-437_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We offer a wide range of premium lens solutions for all vision needs. Simply select the option that best describes your lifestyle and you will be presented with recommended lenses and lens treatments that meet your needs. </p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-EROOM jpOqOK pf-439_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-gvZzpm iHUDiY pf-440_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="a8a7bbd2-a341-4f91-8894-6f91d9655166" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Can I use my contact lens prescription to order glasses?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi pf-442_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-beZfNf kdmZzm pf-443_"><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-444_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">We are sorry, but a contact lens prescription can only be used to order contact lenses since the numbers can vary from a glasses prescription. Please contact the doctor who issued your contact lens prescription to get an up-to-date eyeglass prescription on file.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-EROOM jpOqOK pf-446_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-gvZzpm iHUDiY pf-447_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="9188946f-91d9-4551-a66f-cb005e987d68" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>How do I know if a frame fits me?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi pf-449_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-beZfNf kdmZzm pf-450_"><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-451_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">Here are some rules of thumb: Your pupils should be near the center of the lens. The lenses shouldn’t extend past the side of your face. Your eyebrows should not be inside the glasses. When you smile, your cheeks don’t push the frames up. And the frames shouldn’t slide down your nose.</p></div></div></div></details></div><div class="sc-knuQPt daAiLp pf-453_ pf-icon-right" data-scroll-to-top="true" data-open-multiple="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3"><details class="sc-EROOM jpOqOK pf-454_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-gvZzpm iHUDiY pf-455_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="666fcb00-5e98-4d68-a1ba-bcd14ae60f83" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>What’s the best way to clean my lenses?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi pf-457_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-beZfNf kdmZzm pf-458_"><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-459_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">You can rinse the lens with mild soap and warm water and dry it with a soft cloth. For daily cleaning of light dirt, a few wipes with the lens cloth included in the case are sufficient. Do not use hot water on the lenses as exposure to high heat may cause blistering and cracking.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-EROOM jpOqOK pf-461_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-gvZzpm iHUDiY pf-462_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="6821babc-d14a-460f-83d7-e78ec575123c" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Where can I find my frame’s measurements?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi pf-464_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-beZfNf kdmZzm pf-465_"><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-466_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">All of our frames have some numbers printed on the inside of the temples. These relate to the frame's lens width, bridge width, and temple length. Frame dimensions are listed under Measurements on each product page.</p></div></div></div></details><details class="sc-EROOM jpOqOK pf-468_" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content.Wrapper"><summary><div class="sc-gvZzpm iHUDiY pf-469_ pf-bg-lazy pf-anchor pf-header-item-wrapper" data-header-id="0f83d7e7-8ec5-4512-bcbc-c1b149bfbee6" data-active="false" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Header"><svg class="pf-accordion-icon pfa-chevron-right pfa-arrow" style="width:auto;fill:currentcolor" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 320 512"><path d="M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z"></path></svg><span>Do your glasses offer protection from blue light?</span></div></summary><div class="sc-kRRxPL eBhmAi pf-471_ pf-accordion-body" data-pf-expandable="true" data-pf-type="Accordion3.Content"><div class="pf-accordion-display-content"><div data-pf-type="Accordion3.Flex.Content" class="sc-beZfNf kdmZzm pf-472_"><p class="sc-cuHiig kGTzfw pf-473_" data-pf-type="Paragraph3">For customers concerned about blue light exposure, we offer polycarbonate blue light filter lenses for an additional $50. These lenses block more blue light than standard polycarbonate or high-index lenses and can be added to your order at checkout.</p></div></div></div></details></div></div><a data-pf-type="Button2" class="sc-dMhVqw bOfbPY pf-475_">Learn more</a></div></section></div></div></div><script>
